<title>HONG KONG: Kwoon Chung issues 59 mln shares at HK$ 1.80 each.</title>
<headline>Kwoon Chung issues 59 mln shares at HK$ 1.80 each.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong-based bus line Kwoon Chung Bus Holdings Ltd plans to issue 59 million new shares, or 25 percent of expanded share capital, at HK$1.80 per share, to raise HK$93 million net, the company said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
